flowchart TD
    PR[Approved project environment requirement] --> RES[Provider compatibility resolution]
    RES --> FIND{Compatible promoted environment?}
    FIND -->|yes| REUSE[Reuse promoted generation]
    FIND -->|no family exists| NF[Create environment family project/work]
    FIND -->|family exists but update required| NG[Create new generation work]
    NF --> PLAN[Normal framework plan/test/code lifecycle]
    NG --> PLAN
    PLAN --> ACC[Provider acceptance contract]
    ACC -->|pass| PROM[Promote immutable generation]
    ACC -->|environment defect| FIX[Environment repair/update work]
    FIX --> PLAN
    PROM --> RUN[Run project verification]
    REUSE --> RUN
    RUN --> EV[Evidence binds candidate SHA + environment generation]
